    {"id": "DS-R3", "score": 5, "reason": "Every nextSevenDays field on EP-1 has a type, nullability, format and example. EP-3/4/5 now mark the write responses as changed, and NextDay's declaration site is named in both types.ts files."},
    {"id": "DS-R4", "score": 5, "reason": "C15 now cites impact C15, which states the ignore-in-PATCH precedent. C18 to C20 cite the exact return this.get(id) lines. Shape and the Inactive value are decided by A-06/A-07."},
    {"id": "DS-R5", "score": 5, "reason": "Trade-offs are given for the shared-rule refactor, the single week query, keeping one DoctorDetail shape across write responses, and the picker not writing back to the URL."},
